From: Mason Chang <mason-cw.chang@mediatek.com>
Subject: net: phy: air_en8811h: port vendor v2.0.7 initialization to Airoha

Port the vendor v2.0.7 MCU initialization and optional debugfs diagnostics
from MediaTek patch b360da2d80046d46b3ee85459164c004e7d92a74, dated
2026-01-09. Source: Yuzhii0718/immortalwrt-mt798x-6.6-padavanonly at
118e857cd2a2cacb05ee4ae90fef0c4df21be3dc, target/linux/mediatek/
patches-6.6/999-ephy-en8811h-01-update-driver-to-v2.0.7.patch.

Keep the vendor FW_STATUS clear, INTERNAL gating and first/subsequent
0x1e00d0/0x1e0228 initialization sequence. Retain the upstream CKO provider,
standard rx/tx-polarity with legacy fallback and LED GPIO reinitialization.
Save and restore only this PHY's CKO on suspend/resume. Keep diagnostics
disabled by default, fix their probe/removal lifetime and retain devm
ownership of private data. The source license and authors are preserved.

This does not change the board reset timing, PCS or host link mode.

