+ * LED0 Link 2500/Blink 2500 TxRx   (GPIO5)    <-> BASE_T_LED0,
+ * LED1 Link 1000/Blink 1000 TxRx   (GPIO4)    <-> BASE_T_LED1,
+ * LED2 Link 100 /Blink 100  TxRx   (GPIO3)    <-> BASE_T_LED2,
